+
+Human-eye role cycle (2026-10-28 06:57+08 dispatch, Job 478633). Full-funnel verification of the live studio frontend, complementing the FCP/tap-target verification in #1783. This cycle went one level deeper: user journeys (guest chat, sign-in), form validation, offline/error states, WCAG contrast, keyboard focus, and mobile chat layout. **Four new defects found — none covered by #1783 or any other open work order (dedup check included).**
+
+**Target:** `https://supremeai-studio.pages.dev` (Cloudflare Pages; `supremeai-studio.vercel.app` is the mirror probed by #1783 — both hosts are referenced in `src/utils/portalHosts.test.ts`).
+**Probe window:** 2026-10-27 22:57–23:20 UTC (2026-10-28 06:57–07:20 +08).
